     A* Project:     Project #6 - Fun With Characters
     A* File:        PRJ6PRTF.PRTF
     A* Programmer:  Chris Grimm
     A* Date:        10/16/2026
     A*
     A* Description:
     A*   External printer file definition for the CSCSTP Customer Master
     A*   Report ("Fun With Characters"). Defines report page headers and
     A*   multi-line customer detail records displaying manipulated
     A*   character fields (User ID, Password, Name, Zip, Phone, Year,
     A*   and Balance Due).
     A*
     A* Used By:     PROJECT6.RPGLE
     A*=========================================================================
     A
     A* EXTERNAL PRINTER FILE DEFINITION FOR CSCSTP Customer Master File
     A*
     A                                      REF(CSCSTP)
     A*------ Report Page Heading ----------------------------------------------
     A          R HEADING                   SKIPB(1)
     A                                     1DATE(*SYS *YY)
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                    14'Fun With Characters'
     A                                    36'Page'
     A                                    43PAGNBR
     A                                      EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A          R DETAIL                    SPACEA(1)
     A                                     2'Customer:'
     A            CUSTNO    R             11
     A                                     2'User ID:'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            USERID        33        10
     A                                     2'Password:'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            PASSWORD       9        11
     A                                     2'Name:'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            NAME          26         7
     A                                     2'Zip:'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            ZIP           10         6
     A                                     2'Phone:'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            PHONE         14         8
     A                                     2'Year:'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            YEAROUT        4         7
     A                                     2'Balance:'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            BALANCE       10        12SPACEA(1)

